    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῐ-όδους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όδοντος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>white-toothed,
				white-tusked,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκοὶ ὀδόντες ἀργιόδοντος ὑός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.264
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.60
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.292
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῐ-όδων</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.820
			</span></i>.</div>
